<title>POLAND: PPAB Q1 net rises to PLN 3,0 mln.</title>
<headline>PPAB Q1 net rises to PLN 3,0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPABank preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			4.80   vs   2.40</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  4.80   vs   2.40</p>
<p>    net profit				3.02   vs   1.36</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Pierwszy Polsko-Amerykanski Bank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	    0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues    17.01   vs  11.62</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	  8.35   vs   6.00</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	    3.29   vs   2.48</p>
<p>    costs of commission		   0.26   vs   0.20</p>
<p>    income tax				1.79   vs   1.04</p>
<p>    other taxes			     0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		  0.00   vs   0.00</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
